{"id":"92553ae434bb637e","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure3 Borel Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure — ZFC Measure3 Borel Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure — ZFC Measure3 Borel Measure","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-borel]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure — ZFC Measure3 Borel Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mu\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> (measure-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\)</span> (Borel sigma-algebra, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau),\\mu)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau),\\mu)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Borel measure is a measure on the Borel sigma-algebra generated by the topology <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-borel]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S$ (measure-space predicate, see [[58-df-measure-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)$ (Borel sigma-algebra, see [[58-df-borel]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathr